  "solution": "def max_coins(nums):\n    vals = [1] + nums + [1]\n    n = len(vals)\n    dp = [[0] * n for _ in range(n)]\n    for length in range(2, n):\n        for lo in range(0, n - length):\n            hi = lo + length\n            dp[lo][hi] = max(dp[lo][k] + vals[lo] * vals[k] * vals[hi] + dp[k][hi] for k in range(lo + 1, hi))\n    return dp[0][n - 1]\n",
